      "type": "text",
      "heading": "Designed to Be Recognized.",
      "body": "Every mark begins with an idea.\n\nMy approach to logo design is grounded in simplicity, structure, and intention — translating complex ideas into distinctive visual forms.\n\nThis collection brings together 30 selected logos and emblems, exploring different relationships between typography, geometry, symbolism, and negative space.\n\nSome are built from a single gesture. Others emerge through careful construction and refinement.\n\nWhat connects them is a shared belief: a memorable mark should communicate clearly, remain recognizable, and hold its character across different applications."
    },
